{"id":"c590fb7eaa58168d","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-bqp-contained-pspace.md","title":"BQP ⊆ PSPACE","display":"thm-bqp-contained-pspace — BQP ⊆ PSPACE","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-bqp-contained-pspace","aliases":["28-thm-bqp-contained-pspace","BQP is Contained in PSPACE"],"display":"thm-bqp-contained-pspace — BQP ⊆ PSPACE","depends_on":["[[28-df-bqp]]","[[28-df-pspace]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 10.23","source_printed_pages":"230","source_pdf_pages":"256","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-bqp-contained-pspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-bqp-contained-pspace</span><span>BQP is Contained in PSPACE</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-bqp-contained-pspace — BQP ⊆ PSPACE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0486b96e648a9d6\" href=\"?note=c0486b96e648a9d6\" title=\"28-df-bqp\">28-df-bqp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 10.23"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"230"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"256"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BQP}\">\\(\\mathbf{BQP}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c0486b96e648a9d6\" href=\"?note=c0486b96e648a9d6\" title=\"28-df-bqp\">28-df-bqp</a> 的有限有效门库与经典多项式时间统一性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BQP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{BQP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>深度优先递归计算最终各基态振幅，再对第一位为一的基态求模平方之和。每层局部门至多产生八个前驱，递归深度多项式；足够精度的代数数近似可重用多项式空间。常数间隙吸收舍入误差。书证明草图中末段的“sum of Coeff”须解释为模平方之和，才能得到概率。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.23，印刷页 230；PDF 页 256。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次还复核了对应证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bqp","status":"resolved","id":"c0486b96e648a9d6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bqp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bqp","status":"resolved","id":"c0486b96e648a9d6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BQP}$ 采用 [[28-df-bqp]] 的有限有效门库与经典多项式时间统一性；$\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-pspace]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BQP}$ 采用 [[28-df-bqp]] 的有限有效门库与经典多项式时间统一性；$\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-pspace]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{BQP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BQP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.","display":true}],"bytes":1319,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"复杂性类：[[28-df-bqp]]、[[28-df-qma]]、[[28-thm-bqp-contained-pspace]]。"}],"outgoing":["c0486b96e648a9d6","fd829148f31abddc"]}